  // Coordinates are in the reported end-effector-tip frame: centerline
  // tip = (0,0), workspace x in [-249,249], y in [-229,4]. See of-app/src/Config.h.
  // Small circle (center (0,-110), r25) — a touch smaller than the "Line into arc"
  // shape's r28 arc. Built as TWO pi-arcs (the loader rejects |sweep| > pi). It
